# lane asserts on the real output, not on pre-scripted narration.
#
# Setup (seeded by the lane before replay):
#   No .pi/swarm.yml, no ~/.pi/agent/swarm.yml (fresh machine).
#   No .pi/settings.json swarm block.
#
# Scripted turns:
#   1. Root session_start fires — dual scaffold writes both templates.
#   2. Agent runs bash to verify both files exist and parse to null.
#   3. Agent runs bash to verify second session_start does NOT re-scaffold (flags are one-shot).

